[[Igrupan|Igrupan's]] chickens are 5 chickens located in Scarleton on the Crimson Isle. During the Mage Faction quest line, the chickens escape their coop and [[Igrupan]] will ask the player to bring back all his missing chickens to {{zone|Igrupan's Chicken Coop}}.

These are their locations:
*Henrietta : {{Coordinates|-9|92|-848}}
*Chikira : {{Coordinates|-48|112|-857}}
*Chickovsky : {{Coordinates|-24|116|-813}}
*Cluckles : {{Coordinates|-49|103|-825}}
*Hennifer : {{Coordinates|-63|121|-818}}

The chickens have to be lured back, either by punching them, attacking them with a weapon with {{ench|Knockback}}, with {{Item|Seeds}}, or with a {{Item|Lead}}.

